/*
  vite-env.d.ts
  -------------
  This file tells TypeScript that importing .css files is valid.
  Vite handles CSS imports at build time — TypeScript just needs
  to know they exist so it doesn't throw an error.

  The triple-slash reference above also gives us types for all
  of Vite's special import features (e.g. ?url, ?raw, import.meta.env).
*/
